(431, 'Adventures in', 'Animation', 'English', 'Hollywood', '4K', 133, 'In a vividly imagined version of Baltimore, a small, determined creature named Wesley Ellery sets out to save its shrinking home, with the reluctant help of a wandering wanderer voiced by the spirit of Piper Doyle.', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/62f1D1c_n9k', 'https://tse2.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.zCgu9G9Q6E1VO7w5vo22SQHaKY?r=0&amp;amp;rs=1&amp;amp;pid=ImgDetMain&amp;amp;o=7&amp;amp;rm=3', '2026-10-26', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(432, 'The Setup', 'Thriller', 'Urdu', 'Bollywood', '4K', 105, 'Karan Chatterjee starts receiving messages that only someone watching very closely could send, and as the city of Goa closes in, Aditya Ahluwalia becomes the only person left to trust, or the one person who cannot be trusted at all.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=The%20Setup', '2027-02-27', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(433, 'My Big Denver', 'Comedy', 'English', 'Hollywood', 'IMAX', 104, 'Reese Ellery promises to help Sienna Thorne pull off the wedding of the century in Denver; naturally, absolutely nothing goes according to plan.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=My%20Big%20Denver', '2027-11-19', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(434, 'Double Cross', 'Crime', 'Hindi', 'Bollywood', '2K', 149, 'After a heist in Kolkata goes sideways, Rudra Rana has forty-eight hours to recover what was lost before Kabir Ahluwalia and the rest of the crew turn on each other.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Double%20Cross', '2026-12-17', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(435, 'Fracture Reborn', 'Sci-Fi', 'English', 'Hollywood', 'IMAX', 151, 'Marcus Sutton wakes up in a Boston that remembers a different version of history, and must work with June Thorne to figure out which timeline is real before the correction finishes erasing them both.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Fracture%20Reborn', '2027-03-24', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(436, 'Return of Hanuman', 'Animation', 'Urdu', 'Bollywood', 'HD', 151, 'Return of Hanuman stands as a magnificent achievement in Indian cinema within the animation genre. Rich in emotional depth, cultural nuance, and unforgettable sequences, it leaves an indelible mark on viewers. Its timeless soundtrack and powerful direction solidify its position as an iconic masterpiece.', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/lcZtbfk6u7s', 'https://tse3.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.J5QjKOoP4b7pZTQkSIpwcQHaEK?r=0&amp;rs=1&amp;pid=ImgDetMain&amp;o=7&amp;rm=3', '2027-04-09', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(437, 'Spiderman: Into the Spider-Verse', 'Animation', 'English', 'Hollywood', 'HD', 122, 'Spiderman: Into the Spider-Verse represents an exceptional hallmark of Hollywood animation storytelling. Driven by compelling narrative arcs, top-tier cinematography, and stellar performances, the film deeply resonates with global audiences. It continues to inspire film enthusiasts and remain a standout classic in its category.', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/g4Hbz2jLxvQ', 'https://tse4.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.Otgyv3DIB4aDX81tpbeFIAHaEK?r=0&amp;rs=1&amp;pid=ImgDetMain&amp;o=7&amp;rm=3', '2027-07-11', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(438, 'Die Hard (1988)', 'Action', 'Urdu', 'Bollywood', 'HD', 156, 'NPMC police officer John McClane finds himself trapped in a Los Angeles skyscraper taken over by heavily armed terrorists during a Christmas party. Operating alone with minimal resources, he uses wit and grit to defeat the captors one by one. It remains the ultimate gold standard for single-location action films.', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/gYbW1F_c9eM', 'https://tse3.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.OAGq38hK5Gp2K8m56GYTgwHaLH?r=0&amp;rs=1&amp;pid=ImgDetMain&amp;o=7&amp;rm=3', '2027-05-25', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(439, 'Dead Air Unbound', 'Horror', 'English', 'Hollywood', 'IMAX', 150, 'Wesley Faulkner and Talia Marsh take a caretaker job at an isolated property outside San Diego, only to discover the previous caretakers never actually left.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Dead%20Air%20Unbound', '2026-07-11', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(440, 'False Trail Goa', 'Thriller', 'Hindi', 'Bollywood', 'HD', 98, 'A routine assignment turns dangerous when Kabir Rana uncovers evidence that implicates Anaya Mehra, forcing a race across Goa before the truth gets buried for good.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=False%20Trail%20Goa', '2027-03-28', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(441, 'Wild Unbound', 'Adventure', 'English', 'Hollywood', '4K', 143, 'When an old map surfaces in Miami, Marcus Harmon and Mia Quinn set off on a journey neither expected, chasing a legend that keeps rewriting itself the closer they get to the truth.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Wild%20Unbound', '2027-05-27', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(442, 'The Wedding Unbound', 'Comedy', 'Hindi', 'Bollywood', '2K', 98, 'When Rohan Ahluwalia accidentally becomes the face of a failing local business in Hyderabad, chaos, and an unlikely friendship with Arjun Rana, follow at every turn.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=The%20Wedding%20Unbound', '2026-01-20', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(443, 'Lost Unbound', 'Adventure', 'English', 'Hollywood', '2K', 142, 'When an old map surfaces in New Orleans, Jack Thorne and Jack Beckett set off on a journey neither expected, chasing a legend that keeps rewriting itself the closer they get to the truth.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Lost%20Unbound', '2026-03-10', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(444, 'Beyond Pune', 'Adventure', 'Urdu', 'Bollywood', '4K', 108, 'A weathered guide named Kavya Chatterjee agrees to lead Arjun Sinha across the forgotten trails beyond Pune in search of a relic that vanished generations ago, unaware that the journey will cost them everything they thought they knew about home.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Beyond%20Pune', '2026-10-26', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(445, 'Signal Rising', 'Sci-Fi', 'English', 'Hollywood', 'IMAX', 96, 'Mia Callahan wakes up in a New Orleans that remembers a different version of history, and must work with June Whitfield to figure out which timeline is real before the correction finishes erasing them both.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Signal%20Rising', '2027-02-14', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(446, 'Quiet', 'Romance', 'Urdu', 'Bollywood', 'IMAX', 163, 'Years after a breakup no one really explained, Naina Sethi runs into Aryan Rana again in Lucknow, and old feelings resurface at exactly the wrong, and maybe the right, time.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Quiet', '2027-07-27', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(447, 'Two Hearts Revisited', 'Romance', 'English', 'Hollywood', 'IMAX', 154, 'Roman Quinn and Grant Faulkner meet by accident on a rainy evening in Denver, and what begins as a passing conversation slowly turns into the kind of love neither of them was looking for, or ready to walk away from.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Two%20Hearts%20Revisited', '2027-01-16', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(448, 'Mission: Impossible - Fallout (2018)', 'Action', 'English', 'Hollywood', '2K', 160, 'Ethan Hunt and his IMF team race against time to recover stolen plutonium after a mission goes wrong, pursued by assassins and former allies alike. Featuring jaw-dropping real stunts performed by Tom Cruise, the film keeps tension at maximum. It is hailed as one of the greatest spy action movies ever made.', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/XiHiW4N7-bo', 'https://tse3.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.Tp31qqCWKW6--7XOazrFOgHaJ4?r=0&amp;rs=1&amp;pid=ImgDetMain&amp;o=7&amp;rm=3', '2026-04-24', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(449, 'Beyond', 'Adventure', 'English', 'Hollywood', '2K', 132, 'A weathered guide named Talia Beckett agrees to lead June Cross across the forgotten trails beyond Denver in search of a relic that vanished generations ago, unaware that the journey will cost them everything they thought they knew about home.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=Beyond', '2027-12-08', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49'),
(450, 'The Job Goa', 'Crime', 'Urdu', 'Bollywood', '4K', 129, 'Detective Simran Sethi is pulled back to Goa to close a case that was never really closed, only to find Karan Bajwa at the center of it all along.', NULL, 'https://placehold.co/500x750/11141c/e50914?font=montserrat&text=The%20Job%20Goa', '2027-04-04', 1, '2026-08-21 06:52:49');
